  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/423496062335189014/1114855644680437840/stoneborn_text.png\" alt=\"Логотип Stoneborn, снизу надпись Meï&#x27;s Additions\" width=\"1241\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">STONEBORN - Me&iuml;'s Additions — это дополнение для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-ui-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">STONEBORN - Dwarven-Fantasy Inspired UI Overhaul</a> (от Sindavar33) и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-modded-compatibility-sbmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">STONEBORN - Modded Compatibility GUI - SBMC</a> (от Fr_z_n), цель которого — добавить совместимость с ещё большим количеством модов!</span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"Разделитель\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">Оригинальный пакет STONEBORN от Sindavar33</span></strong></span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">STONEBORN - Me&iuml;'s Additions создавался с учётом как оригинального пакета STONEBORN, так и дополнений от Fr_z_n. Таким образом, для наилучшего опыта использования необходимы оба пакета. Этот пакет ресурсов не заменяет те же элементы интерфейса, что и пакет Fr_z_n (за исключением нескольких крайних случаев), а работает совместно с ним</span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Рекомендуемый порядок загрузки следующий:</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- STONEBORN - Dwarven-Fantasy Inspired UI Overhaul</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- STONEBORN - Me&iuml;'s Additions</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- STONEBORN - Modded Compatiblity GUI - SBMC</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/459/226/637734804507733830.png\" alt=\"Основная страница STONEBORN\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></em></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">-</span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-modded-compatibility-sbmc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/403/638080725702354339.png\" alt=\"STONEBORN Fr_z_n: дополнительные модифицированные интерфейсы\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-modded-compatibility-sbmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">-</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"Разделитель\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Начиная с версии 1.0, поддерживаются следующие моды (некоторые частично, если пакет Fr_z_n уже поддерживал их часть!) :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">(Обратите внимание, что я тестировал всё только через Forge и не могу гарантировать поддержку в версиях модов для Fabric)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Statues</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bartering-station\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bartering Station</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewin-and-chewin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brewin' and Chewin'</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/camera-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Camera Mod</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chalk</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisels &amp; Bits</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clayworks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clayworks</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-libraries\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Libraries</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Anvils</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Magic</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-mail\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender Mail</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com