 href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nourished Nether / Phantasmic</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obscure API</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins (Forge)</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pane-in-the-glass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pane in the Glass</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/revampedwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Revamped Wolf</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-gods\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG Gods</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sculked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sculked</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/signpost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Signpost</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sooty Chimneys</a></span></p>\n<p><