 style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Добавлено в версии 1.2:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zenith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zenith</a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Добавлено в версии 1.3:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alcocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alcocraft+</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomancy</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do API</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/domum-ornamentum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Domum Ornamentum</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightend</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extradelight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Delight</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Aircraft</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-bakery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Bakery</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beachparty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Beachparty</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-candlelight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Candlelight</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/welcome-to-meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Meadow</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Malum</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Mounts</a> (Forge, но, думаю, на Fabric интерфейс такой же!)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/red-power\" rel=\"nofollow\">Red Power</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/proficiency-honest-work\" rel=\"nofollow\">Proficiency: Honest Work (Levels)</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">Известные проблемы:</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">На данный момент нет!<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Этот сборник вместе со сборником Fr_z_n должен покрывать все интерфейсы в Medieval Minecraft [FORGE] 1.19.2 (MMC3), а также обеспечивать поддержку других модов.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Большое спасибо chorb из Luna Pixel Studios за то, что подтолкнули меня выпустить сборник на CurseForge!</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Не стесняйтесь попробовать их сборник! :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/55/medievallogo.png\" alt=\"Medieval Minecraft logo\" width=\"1920\" height=\"596\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;-</span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Проект опубликован с разрешения Sindavar33:</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/423496062335189014/1114892971633033246/Discord_QyaoeLmWnM.png\" alt=\"Разрешение от Sindavar&#x27;s на публикацию этого производного проекта\" width=\"1589\" height=\"746\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Если вам нравится мой контент, не стесняйтесь <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmeixdev\" rel=\"nofollow\">угостить меня лимонадом или поддержать на Ko-fi</a>!</span></p>\n&lt;menu id=&quot;fcltHTML5Menu1&quot; type=&quot;context&quot;&gt;&lt;/menu&gt;&lt;menu id=&quot;fcltHTML5Menu1&quot; type=&quot;context&quot;&gt;&lt;/menu&gt;",
